=== technical_detail ===
To gather concrete learning data for our client, The Heroes Church, I integrated interactive Bible quizzes, daily quizzes, and NPC-driven trivia directly into the gameplay. 

The system also tracks exactly how much time players spend reading biblical text within the game, packaging all of this data into a clear analytics report for our client.
-> END